### FilmFuse core-api - content comfort settings (hard filters on every recommendation you are part of)
# Token: see me.http. Certifications: G | PG | PG_13 | R | NC_17 (null = no limit).
# Dimensions: VIOLENCE | SEXUAL | LANGUAGE | DRUGS | FRIGHTENING; levels: NONE | MILD | MODERATE | STRONG.
# A missing dimension (or STRONG) = no limit. allowUnrated: may movies with unknown certification /
# content level pass a limit? Default false.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Current settings (defaults: null, {}, false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/settings/comfort
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### "I'll watch R, but only mild gore and no sex scenes"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/settings/comfort
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxCertification": "R",
  "contentLimits": {"VIOLENCE": "MILD", "SEXUAL": "NONE"},
  "allowUnrated": false
}

### Back to no limits (a PUT replaces everything; omitted fields take their defaults)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/settings/comfort
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Unknown value -> 400 ("PG-13" is the display form; the API value is PG_13)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/settings/comfort
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"maxCertification": "PG-13"}
